[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `libgedit-tepl-dev`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked
at a later version, with `py3-txacme`. The later `libgedit-tepl-dev`
needs `pc:libgedit-gfls-1>=0.3`, which the installed
`libgedit-gfls-dev` 0.3.1 and the repository's 0.4.1 both provide, and
`libgedit-gtksourceview-dev`, whose one candidate admitted needs
`pc:libgedit-gfls-1>=0.4`. That leaves 0.4.1 the only candidate, whose
`libgedit-gfls=0.4.1-r0` is required before `libgedit-gfls` is decided;
apk upgrades both.

